    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer's Note</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/7bb649c953d55ab064d00449d7d00412.poster.avif?t=1751615161\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/7bb649c953d55ab064d00449d7d00412.apng?t=1751615161\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=117 /></picture></span><strong>As I graduate from university, I've decided to release the game I've spent two years developing. This marks the culmination of my efforts over time,</strong> and I hope more fans of this genre can join the playtest and provide any feedback. Your support is my greatest motivation moving forward! Thank you!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aComputer Dungeon\u300bDiscussion QQ Group: 435541863<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Computer dungeons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single-player roguelike strategy game. In the game we play as an awakened artificial intelligence, exploring in a dungeon of various hardware drivers and system software, where monsters with different attributes and skills, items with multiple effects, rewards and plots, armed by learning a series of functional functions, you can independently combine them to achieve unexpected results.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/eb7d5d7589c139bcc1fe253cd4c4714b.poster.avif?t=1751615161\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/eb7d5d7589c139bcc1fe253cd4c4714b.webp?t=1751615161\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=280 /></picture></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drive the scan module</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your innate scanner can detect hazards in your vicinity, and it will tell you the number of enemies around you that may pose a threat to you, and combine this information with a reasonable selection of areas to explore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/7b0309cd9d87ba054463565de80dc7c8.poster.avif?t=1751615161\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/7b0309cd9d87ba054463565de80dc7c8.webm?t=1751615161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the levels, meet different enemies and random events, and unlock the story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the levels, you'll find many items with different effects to choose from, so use them at the right time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/59a34df9095280ef1a444b79ccab9ee0.poster.avif?t=1751615161\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/59a34df9095280ef1a444b79ccab9ee0.webm?t=1751615161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/59a34df9095280ef1a444b79ccab9ee0.mp4?t=1751615161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >As you progress through the levels, you'll encounter powerful enemies with different skills, unlocking your corresponding talents to counter them</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/fe826053b2014fc10b852dc530a82ac2.poster.avif?t=1751615161\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/fe826053b2014fc10b852dc530a82ac2.webp?t=1751615161\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=280 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>Choose and unlock your Gifted Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have different powerful talents in your tech tree, so match the effects between them and create your own faction! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/060fb76a18df25e0d6e3ec8dcec996d1.poster.avif?t=1751615161\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/060fb76a18df25e0d6e3ec8dcec996d1.webm?t=1751615161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/060fb76a18df25e0d6e3ec8dcec996d1.mp4?t=1751615161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat style with a strategic theme</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/5ee6e17379e92e097e0016d0f5f30c7a.poster.avif?t=1751615161\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/5ee6e17379e92e097e0016d0f5f30c7a.webm?t=1751615161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/5ee6e17379e92e097e0016d0f5f30c7a.mp4?t=1751615161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Players can use their wits and combine different talents and skills to achieve the best combat results</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interesting and novel text content<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/599ef3880320b361a6c5496094b30a60.poster.avif?t=1751615161\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/599ef3880320b361a6c5496094b30a60.webp?t=1751615161\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=280 /></picture></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different choices will give you a different experience in the future</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/ebbf07929d06b08b8b9b3b272408c3dc.poster.avif?t=1751615161\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/ebbf07929d06b08b8b9b3b272408c3dc.webm?t=1751615161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/ebbf07929d06b08b8b9b3b272408c3dc.mp4?t=1751615161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the level, you'll encounter different choice events, so make the best choice based on your current situation!</p></h2>",
